-- Description:
--   This script contains all SQL queries used to generate
--   the CSV outputs consumed by the Power BI dashboard.
--
--   Each query is mapped to:
--   - The bootcamp question number
--   - The output CSV filename
--   - The Power BI dashboard page/visual that uses it
